cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its CBDB-derived outputs, please cite both
  this repository and the underlying China Biographical Database (CBDB) as below."
title: "cbdb_analysis: CBDB SQLite 增强版（分析视图 + 知识图谱 + 查询台）"
abstract: >-
  On top of the official cbdb-project/cbdb_sqlite release, this repository adds
  analytical SQL views (kinship genealogy, county-level people, single-text
  associations, person life timeline, property-graph edge table), a materialized
  life-event interval table (LIFE_EVENT_RESOLVED) built from a Simple Temporal
  Problem with arc-consistency propagation, an Owlready2/RDF-OWL knowledge graph
  (TBox v1.0 + Ming-dynasty seed quadstore), and a Vue 3 web query console with
  three modes (view search, person chronicle, and knowledge-graph exploration
  serving topics Q1-Q9, force-directed graphs, CSV export and streaming ETL).
  No database binaries are stored in the repository; all data must be downloaded
  from the official CBDB channels.
type: software
authors:
